        "а) $(-2x)^4=8x\\cdot2x^3$；",
        "б) $(-6a^2)^2a^3=(2a^2)^3\\cdot4.5a$；",
        "в) $-8b\\cdot0.3b^7=0.6b^6(-4b^2)$；",
        "г) $\\frac{7x^2y^4}{4}:0.28=(2.5xy^2)^2$．"
